{
  "_comment": "Generated from data/case_tables dialogue CSV.",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "……你就是那个同船的御史？我叫周德茂，做布匹生意。这次是去武昌府进一批棉布。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "周老板是做什么生意的？",
          "goto": "ask_business",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "为什么选夜船？",
          "goto": "ask_night_ferry",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵跟了你多久？",
          "goto": "ask_servant",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "看看船舱里有什么",
          "goto": "observe_cabin",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "夜深了，先休息",
          "goto": "__exit__",
          "type": "observe",
          "requires": [
            {
              "all": [
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_agui_talked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_lao_fan_talked"
                },
                {
                  "flag": "cabin_zhou_talked"
                },
                {
                  "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "set_flags": [
            "cabin_explore_done"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_business": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "不算大。就是混口饭吃。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "这次是去武昌府进一批棉布，过了年好卖。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "周老板谦虚了。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_night_ferry": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "急着赶路。武昌的早市不能错过。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "夜船快。半天就到。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "夜船危险。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "我知道。但时间不等人。而且……有人告诉我这条路快。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他顿了顿，像是在斟酌用词）",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "是个做药材的朋友。说这条船靠谱，船家跑了二十年。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "做药材的朋友？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "嗯。姓沈。以前在武昌做过药材生意。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_servant": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "阿贵跟了我十二年。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "十六岁进的门。什么都不会——是我手把手教的。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年了……不短了。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年……确实不短。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "observe_cabin": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_observed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "船舱不大，但收拾得还算干净。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "舱壁上挂着一根铁撬棍，旁边是蓑衣和斗笠。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "角落有几只木箱，用麻绳捆着。",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "（铁撬棍的位置有点奇怪——挂在舱壁正中间，像是特意放在那里的。）",
          "speaker_id": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "text": "这铁撬棍放得倒显眼……",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "emotion": "serious"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
